          "description": "View example molecules and match each to its VSEPR prediction: CO2 linear, BF3 trigonal planar, CH4 tetrahedral, PF5 trigonal bipyramidal, SF6 octahedral, NH3 trigonal pyramidal, H2O bent, and XeF4 square planar."
        },
